  "html": "<p><b>In Frump's Misfortune, you can search for Special Relics such as <i>Opportunity</i>, track down Frump's sworn enemy <a class=\"missing\" href=\"/wiki/Roh-zee\" title=\"Roh-zee\">Roh-zee</a>, and most importantly participate in the Dungeon Idol series.</b>\n</p>\n\n<div id=\"mw-subcategories\">\n<h2>Subcategories</h2>\n<p>There are 8 subcategories to this category.\n</p><table width=\"100%\"><tr valign=\"top\"><td>\n<h3>E</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Exploring_Frump's_Misfortune_Quests\" title=\"Category:Exploring Frump's Misfortune Quests\">Exploring Frump's Misfortune Quests</a></li></ul>\n<h3>F</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Frump's_Hunt_and_Destroy_Quests\" title=\"Category:Frump's Hunt and Destroy Quests\">Frump's Hunt and Destroy Quests</a></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td>\n<h3>F cont.</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Frump's_Special_Relic_Quests\" title=\"Category:Frump's Special Relic Quests\">Frump's Special Relic Quests</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Frump's_Termination_Quests\" title=\"Category:Frump's Termination Quests\">Frump's Termination Quests</a></li></ul>\n<h3>I</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Idolatry_Quest_Line\" title=\"Category:Idolatry Quest Line\">Idolatry Quest Line</a></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td>\n<h3>J</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Je'zzee's_Mess_Quest_Line\" title=\"Category:Je'zzee's Mess Quest Line\">Je'zzee's Mess Quest Line</a></li></ul>\n<h3>M</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Miss_Behavin'_Series\" title=\"Category:Miss Behavin' Series\">Miss Behavin' Series</a></li></ul>\n<h3>O</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Our_Misfortune_Quest_Line\" title=\"Category:Our Misfortune Quest Line\">Our Misfortune Quest Line</a></li></ul>\n</td>\n</tr></table>\n</div><div id=\"mw-pages\">\n<h2>Articles in category \"Frump's Misfortune Quests\"</h2>\n<p>There are 37 articles in this category.\n</p><table width=\"100%\"><tr valign=\"top\"><td>\n<h3>A</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/An_Explorer's